{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20269b9c0QA4nf1795763788.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>廉政專員胡英明代表廉署，成功連任國際反貪局聯合會主席。</p><p></p><p>胡英明出席在摩洛哥舉行的國際反貪局聯合會會員大會，在全球逾300名反貪機構代表出席下成功連任。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.ICAC-1500_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026250Eco0hAJ1795763879.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>新一屆任期是三年，胡英明指會積極推動多邊合作，建立更強大聯合會。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T08:24:03.447815+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T07:11:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T08:37:20.158940+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T08:17:18.656869+00:00","content_hash":"f081f9c8485c1f92e03b37315c573e330b1cdf218ad4518688e45bce5fe17701","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T08:24:03.447815+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}